        "label": "Launch — Proton-K / Blok D",
        "description": "Baikonur Cosmodrome, 1971-05-28. Soviet Mars 3 — an orbiter + lander combined. Twin of Mars 2 (launched 9 days earlier and crashed). Part of the Soviet Mars campaign during the 1971 launch window."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 0.005,
